{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321410001:1":{"text":"お兄ちゃん、またお酒を飲んだでしょ！しかも雪の上で寝てたんだよ！","source_cn":"哥哥！你又喝酒，还躺在雪地里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x711B916DAE11EF7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321410002:1":{"text":"もし僕たちが探しに来なかったら、今頃どうなってたと思うの！？僕を一人にしないでよ……","source_cn":"如果不是有人来找你，出事了该怎么办？你不能丢下我一个人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A62CC8F9F61822C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321410003:1":{"text":"ああ……ごめんよ、ピーター。","source_cn":"唉……抱歉，彼得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFACD3547CD74F0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321410004:1":{"text":"それにあなたたちも、ピーターに付き添ってくれてありがとう。","source_cn":"也得谢谢你们，陪彼得来找我。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDF415C09B3A9EFF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それにあなたたちも、ピーターに付き添ってくれてありがとう。","female":"それにあなたたちも、ピーターに付き添ってくれてありがとう。","variant_male_record_index":"150265","variant_female_record_index":"150266","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1321410004":{"text":"それにあなたたちも、ピーターに付き添ってくれてありがとう。","source_cn":"也得谢谢你们，陪彼得来找我。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDF415C09B3A9EFF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"それにあなたたちも、ピーターに付